    primitive_api_lint_ac_d1_and_ac_d2_are_contradictory_2026-08-04, 1, "Triage 2026-11-04 (no change, lint rules owned by other lanes): still a spec/rule design contradiction (lint_primitive_api.spl:160 _all_same_primitive is a single-line text scan). Proposed resolution for owner: AC-D2 discriminator = body is a pass-through to an extern fn, implemented in the AST-driven primitive_api.spl check_call_site, leaving the EasyFix text rule to AC-D1 only. QUESTION: accept that split, or drop AC-D2?"

